proven = "Offline tests read the actual repaired README, parse its component rows, Mermaid containment/edges, shell examples with shlex and JSON request with json.loads, and reject retired launches. They trace documented linking through root Makefile prerequisites, chain.mk output and cgo linker flags into node/app.go; compare documented node launch flags with the production start_native Python AST; check finality rungs and source ordering from receipt producer through committed block lookup; parse the real hosted OpenRPC contract and check gateway relay policy and committed public endpoint reference. Only README.md is a finding target; no shell scripts, unit files or manifests are repaired, so no bash or external parser is needed."
